message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "HISS-Assess: Hospitality Information Security Standard Assessment Toolkit"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Thiyagarajan"
    given-names: "Raghunath"
version: "1.0"
license: MIT
abstract: "HISS-Assess is an offline Python toolkit that scores a hotel property against the HISS Framework v1.0 control catalogue. It produces maturity scores, coverage of reference standards, legal readiness by jurisdiction, a gap report, a remediation roadmap and a self contained HTML dashboard. It was built for a Year 2 capstone in MS Cyber Security at REVA University."
keywords:
  - hotel information security
  - control framework
  - maturity assessment
  - standards crosswalk
  - data protection law
